  "description": {
    "raw": "You instill courage in the subject, granting it a +4 morale bonus against fear effects for 10 minutes. If the subject is under the influence of a fear effect when receiving the spell, that effect is suppressed for the duration of the spell.\n\nRemove fear counters and dispels cause fear.",
